(8) Part of the Act on Integrated Support for Community Care, Including Medical and Long-Term Care, Act No. 20415, shall be amended as follows:
In Article 15, subparagraph 2, "nurses under Article 2 (2) 5 of the Medical Service Act" shall be replaced with "nurses under Article 12 of the Nursing Act."
(9) through (14) Omitted.

